# The inline column over a `/model` line the caret has left: an Alt-Enter
# after the id puts the caret on a second row, and the column hangs from the
# caret row's start (`projectedAnchorColumn`, visual_layout.zig:704-712).
models models.json
fx: seed model-seed-fx.json
xfx: seed model-seed-xfx.json
nomodel
wait 2.5
type /model xai/grok-4.7
wait 0.5
snap typed
key M-Enter
wait 0.5
snap alt-enter
